<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2208] Queries with object arguments doesn&apos;t work wth BinaryMarshaller.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2208</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This happens because we cannot compare binary and non-binary objects.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Problematic code frame: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;GridH2ValueCacheObject.compareSecure
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Affected tests:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;IgniteCacheAbstractQuerySelfTest.testObjectQuery
IgniteCacheAbstractQuerySelfTest.testBadHashObjectKey
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12922988">IGNITE-2208</key>
            <summary>Queries with object arguments doesn&apos;t work wth BinaryMarshaller.</summary>
